WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.500
It seems that nearly every small town has
one place you’re always told to avoid.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.079
Maybe it’s an out of commission water tower,
or an old power plant that’s blocked off

00:00:10.079 --> 00:00:15.540
with a large fence that your parents warned
you time and time again to never go anywhere

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.540
near.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.470
But of course the words ‘Caution’, ‘Danger
of Death’ or ‘Private Property’ often

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:26.970
seem less like a warning and more like a challenge
to a bored kid living in a small town.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:31.260
In this instance, the place beyond the chain
link fence you’re not supposed to cross

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:36.990
is a local radio station, a towering transmitter
that looks like a huge needle pointed at the

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:37.990
sky.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:42.520
On those long walks home from school you were
always tempted to climb over the fence, just

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.590
to get a closer look at the tower.

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:48.420
If you were quick enough, you could dash back
over and no one would ever know.

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:53.810
Then, one day, you throw caution to the wind
and ignore all the warnings - because what’s

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:55.950
life without a little bit of adventure?

00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:01.329
You cross the metal fence to go and investigate
the radio tower, but somehow the closer you

00:01:01.329 --> 00:01:04.559
step, the further away it seems to be.

00:01:04.559 --> 00:01:07.790
You walk and walk but still never get closer.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.100
How much time has passed?

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.330
Has it been hours?

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:12.330
Days?

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:13.330
Even Months?

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:17.990
Before you know it, you’ve spent ten long
years walking in circles, trying every which

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:20.380
way just to visit the tower.

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:25.799
As it turns out, you probably should have
paid attention to all the warning signs.

00:01:25.799 --> 00:01:32.340
Contained behind a perimeter fence is SCP-084,
or as it is known among Foundation staff - the

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.060
Static Tower.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:40.369
Exactly what is transmitted from SCP-084 is
intriguing, but also highly disturbing.

00:01:40.369 --> 00:01:43.950
Researchers working for the SCP Foundation
have found that they are unable to properly

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:50.170
examine the Static Tower, as anyone that gets
within a one hundred meter radius of SCP-084

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:53.330
suffers from various anomalous effects.

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:59.510
It seems that SCP-084 is able to transmit
a radio frequency, or possibly even a form

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:02.170
of radiation, of unknown origin.

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:07.610
This emission appears to have an adverse effect
on the space and time of the local area.

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:12.620
This distortion has a limited radius, only
reaching an active area that surrounds the

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.930
Static Tower in a dome shape.

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:19.980
Anything contained within this dome will both
witness and experience the alterations that

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:22.700
SCP-084 causes.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:27.480
The most commonly occurring of SCP-084’s
different effects is that the tower appears

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:34.030
to teleport at random intervals, able to disappear
from one location and reappear at another.

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:39.540
Sometimes, the Static Tower will even appear
to materialize in several locations at once,

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:43.599
not staying quite as static as its nickname
would suggest.

00:02:43.599 --> 00:02:48.490
It does seem to be limited to the field it
was discovered in, but wherever in that space

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:54.959
SCP-084 ‘jumps’ to, the dome-shaped active
area around it will also move, keeping the

00:02:54.959 --> 00:02:56.690
tower at its center.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:03:01.500
Due to the space and time warping effects
it emits, the Static Tower is impossible to

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:05.450
reach, either on foot or through the use of
any type of vehicle.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:09.560
Any attempts to get close enough to examine
the tower have ended the same.

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:15.560
The space within the surrounding dome appears
to be unlimited, meaning that SCP-084 stays

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:19.710
at a relative distance, as if it is always
stuck on the horizon.

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:25.790
No matter how long someone travels towards
it - days, weeks, months or even years - the

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.819
Static Tower will remain out of reach.

00:03:28.819 --> 00:03:33.840
One man that the Foundation encountered within
SCP-084’s area of effect, had apparently

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:39.730
been trying for six years to reach the tower,
traveling miles upon miles but never getting

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:40.940
any closer.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.580
Additionally, the tower cannot be destroyed.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:48.050
The Foundation has already attempted a number
of conventional methods of destruction, but

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:53.160
these have similarly never been able to reach
SCP-084.

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:58.460
Even if a projectile is launched from outside
the active area dome that surrounds the tower,

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.240
it will never hit its intended target.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:06.330
The Static Tower can warp nearby space around
it, almost in self-defense.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:11.590
Distances can randomly extend or contract,
causing the tower and its two small outbuildings

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:15.720
to suddenly teleport away in order to avoid
incoming damage.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:20.680
During the Foundation’s lengthy and ongoing
observation of the Static Tower, a vast number

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.689
of anomalous occurrences have taken place.

00:04:23.689 --> 00:04:28.669
Among those documented by the SCP Foundation’s
sentries and researchers, is the bizarre behavior

00:04:28.669 --> 00:04:31.409
of any animals spotted nearby.

00:04:31.409 --> 00:04:36.199
Very few can actually be found within the
active area dome, and any seen beyond the

00:04:36.199 --> 00:04:39.880
dome’s threshold appear to instinctively
know to avoid it.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:45.860
Any animals that do happen to appear within
the area surrounding SCP-084 will exhibit

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:47.849
very strange behavior.

00:04:47.849 --> 00:04:51.669
Their movements shudder, or repeat in loops
like a gif.

00:04:51.669 --> 00:04:56.479
These abnormalities suggest that they are
not real animals, but merely strange copies

00:04:56.479 --> 00:05:01.360
with only a limited, repetitive pattern of
movement that ends when they disappear after

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.629
three to four hours.

00:05:03.629 --> 00:05:08.110
Speech also seems to be affected when someone
is within the dome, with a number of reports

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:13.849
describing vocal communication being muffled
when inside the area around the Static Tower.

00:05:13.849 --> 00:05:19.059
Other times, when people stand apart, their
voices begin to echo, with words usually being

00:05:19.059 --> 00:05:23.539
heard several seconds after they are uttered
by a speaker, or even after they have stopped

00:05:23.539 --> 00:05:25.689
speaking altogether.

00:05:25.689 --> 00:05:30.370
Within the active area dome around the Static
Tower, the local environment also seems to

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:33.219
be affected by the tower’s anomalous properties.

00:05:33.219 --> 00:05:39.330
Rain, snow, hail or sudden heatwaves will
occur seemingly at random, and usually the

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:43.319
weather within the dome is completely different
to that outside.

00:05:43.319 --> 00:05:48.800
The sky will flicker and blur between different
states as well, shifting from day to night,

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.740
or clear to cloudy at a moment’s notice.

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:57.259
Additionally, no damage can be done to the
environment around SCP-084, even digging up

00:05:57.259 --> 00:06:00.270
the ground will cause the earth to reset itself.

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:05.849
Situated near the field where SCP-084 can
be found, is a small township, however this

00:06:05.849 --> 00:06:12.990
location is only visible to anyone that finds
themselves within the active dome around SCP-084.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:17.360
It has been speculated that this town was
a part of the local area, and may have existed

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:22.090
before the Static Tower first manifested,
but that it has since become subjected to

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.559
the tower’s distortion of reality.

00:06:24.559 --> 00:06:29.469
According to further investigations, the town
has an unchanging population.

00:06:29.469 --> 00:06:34.629
Only three hundred and forty three people
reside there, no more and no less.

00:06:34.629 --> 00:06:38.879
It appears that new births are impossible
and cannot occur within this town.

00:06:38.879 --> 00:06:43.249
In much the same spirit, nobody living there
can die.

00:06:43.249 --> 00:06:47.849
Any attempts at homicide result in ‘dead’
persons flickering before being returned to

00:06:47.849 --> 00:06:49.849
life seconds after dying.

00:06:49.849 --> 00:06:56.080
There have also been reports from this town
of events reversing, almost as if time rewinds.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:01.229
This has most notably occurred when any town
resident suffers a fatal accident, or receives

00:07:01.229 --> 00:07:03.729
an extreme wound of some kind.

00:07:03.729 --> 00:07:08.270
When this happens, the affected individual
will be able to witness their injury visibly

00:07:08.270 --> 00:07:10.719
freeze and then reverse itself.

00:07:10.719 --> 00:07:14.589
Cuts close and bones reset all on their own.

00:07:14.589 --> 00:07:18.449
People within the dome, like the residents
of the nearby town, will sometimes exhibit

00:07:18.449 --> 00:07:24.149
spontaneous “blurring”, their arms, legs,
or heads shuddering violently at impossible

00:07:24.149 --> 00:07:25.159
speeds.

00:07:25.159 --> 00:07:29.770
Despite this being physically impossible without
injury, any subject seen blurring usually

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:34.919
remains unaware of this, and feels no pain
from the sudden gyration.

00:07:34.919 --> 00:07:39.429
Much like the animals within the dome, human
beings will also get stuck in isolated time

00:07:39.429 --> 00:07:44.300
loops, repeating simple actions without being
able to control themselves.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.599
Someone might freeze after walking through
a door, flicker out of existence for a split

00:07:48.599 --> 00:07:54.849
second, only to appear at their original starting
point and walk through the same door again.

00:07:54.849 --> 00:07:59.699
According to the findings of Foundation researchers,
the town residents living within the vicinity

00:07:59.699 --> 00:08:04.139
of SCP-084, no longer have basic human needs.

00:08:04.139 --> 00:08:09.569
They don’t get hungry or starve, they cannot
be dehydrated, and don’t even sleep thanks

00:08:09.569 --> 00:08:13.490
to being trapped within the Static Tower’s
area of effect.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:18.099
At random moments, townsfolk will be able
to phase through solid matter, walking through

00:08:18.099 --> 00:08:20.649
walls or phasing through floors.

00:08:20.649 --> 00:08:26.580
This effect seems to last for brief periods
of time, but can often have catastrophic results.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:31.110
Any passing through a surface or object when
this period ends, will often end up stuck

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:33.629
until the effect reoccurs.

00:08:33.629 --> 00:08:38.959
Being unable to die, this does not kill these
individuals, and instead they end up painfully

00:08:38.959 --> 00:08:41.010
fused with solid matter.

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:46.770
One person even found themselves trapped in
a wall from the waist down for two whole years.

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:53.190
Long term exposure to SCP-084 and its various
anomalous effects has caused the 343 residents

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:57.310
of the nearby town untold amounts of harm
and distress.

00:08:57.310 --> 00:09:02.389
One can only dread to think of their collective
psychological state, having to live life in

00:09:02.389 --> 00:09:04.370
an undetectable bubble.

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:10.110
Getting stuck in time loops, repeating mundane
actions over and over again.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:13.910
Phasing through surfaces only to find themselves
stuck in place.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:19.000
These unlucky souls have no means of reprieve
or means of escape.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:24.839
All information regarding SCP-084 has to be
documented on paper, as electronic devices

00:09:24.839 --> 00:09:30.550
such as cameras, phones, computers are unable
to properly function and record while inside

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:33.339
the Static Tower’s area of effect.

00:09:33.339 --> 00:09:38.920
Any audio or video playback devices, such
as radios or camcorders, often detect bizarre

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.710
and unsettling transmissions.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:45.740
It is unknown if these originate from the
tower itself though, or are just the result

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:49.500
of using electronics within the active area
surrounding it.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:55.690
The dome that engulfs this town with SCP-084
at its center has left the area completely

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.629
isolated from the world.

00:09:57.629 --> 00:10:02.700
It is because of this that there is little
the SCP Foundation can do to contain the Static

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:06.060
Tower, other than wait and watch.

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:11.310
Personnel are instructed not to attempt any
interaction with SCP-084, and instead the

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:16.339
tower has been placed under round the clock
surveillance to monitor any changes and observe

00:10:16.339 --> 00:10:19.069
any anomalous effects it may cause.

00:10:19.069 --> 00:10:24.360
The Foundation hopes to divert any unwanted
civilian attention away from the area.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:30.940
There are no roads or publicly accessible
routes leading to SCP-084 or the nearby town,

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:35.410
and Foundation security will detain anyone
that somehow finds their way headed towards

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.149
the Static Tower.

00:10:37.149 --> 00:10:41.810
Only with full permission of two O5 Council
members are researchers and other Foundation

00:10:41.810 --> 00:10:44.740
personnel permitted to enter the dome.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:49.070
Sentry teams provide additional security and
are stationed nearby within the tower’s

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:50.440
line of sight.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:55.300
These units have to be near enough to see
the tower with their own eyes, as even viewing

00:10:55.300 --> 00:11:01.740
SCP-084 through binoculars or telescopes makes
the tower appear fuzzy and out of focus.

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:08.330
All electronic devices, including radios,
televisions, cell phones, video or photo cameras,

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:14.290
Global Positioning Systems, are banned from
the vicinity of SCP-084.

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:18.399
This is done in the hopes of avoiding any
unwelcome interference from the tower’s

00:11:18.399 --> 00:11:20.600
reality warping frequency.

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:26.759
Any civilian in the nearby area carrying any
of these devices or attempting to record SCP-084

00:11:26.759 --> 00:11:32.290
by any means will have their electronics confiscated
and their recordings destroyed.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:37.000
Given that no-one can get close enough, or
even examine it from a distance with binoculars

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:44.350
or other implements, there exists no detailed
description of what’s inside SCP-084.

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:49.110
All that is known about its physical makeup
is what can be seen from a distance… that

00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:51.770
it is a solitary radio tower.

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:57.009
The SCP Foundation has, as of yet, also been
unable to determine the exact nature of what

00:11:57.009 --> 00:12:00.660
is being transmitted by SCP-084.

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:05.620
Does the Static Tower send out a frequency
so powerful that it can warp space and time?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:11.360
And if so, is the tower itself sentient, or
was it designed by someone for exactly this

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:12.570
purpose?

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:17.120
Whatever the answer is, we would recommend
keeping your distance from this hazardous

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.120
site.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:22.430
Perhaps it would be best to abide by the warning
signs for the time being.

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:27.100
After all, you’d hate to wander too far
and not be able to make your way back.

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:34.399
Now check out “SCP-823 - Carnival of Horrors”
and “SCP-1730 - What Happened to Site-13?

00:12:34.399 --> 00:12:40.019
The Full Story Compilation” for more diabolical
anomalous locations from SCP Explained!

